{
  "_comment": [
    "lock-detector ss probe (issue #145): single-corner diagnostic. NOT a graded spec result",
    "(sim/corners.json: the reduced set is never a recorded result) and NOT the tt smoke gate --",
    "sim/lock-detector-smoke/requests/ld.request.json is untouched.",
    "Question (issue #145): PR #141 shortened the shared edgedet one-shot from five inverter stages",
    "to three device-level stages (XMPD1..XMND3, 0.16 u); does pt still set the plain srlatch at",
    "ss/1.080 V/125 C, i.e. does LOCK rise at all after the stimulus goes clean?",
    "Deck = design/netlist/lock_detector.spice (three-stage edgedet) + decks/ld_body.spice,",
    "stimulus byte-identical to the tt smoke bench (the stimulus is not what changed).",
    "Corner = the bench's own corner with the MOS section moved to mos_ss; the passive sections",
    "(cornerRES res_typ + cornerCAP cap_typ, needed by the vmov_cmp rppd low-pass and its MIM cap)",
    "stay typ, per sim/corners.json, whose corner axes are MOS x supply x temperature only.",
    "Graded on crossing counts and crossing times, NOT on the tt-calibrated .meas windows of the",
    "smoke request: crossing counting is corner-portable, so no tt offset is re-derived for this",
    "corner (issue #145 finding 4 answered by construction). The capture spans the stimulus (ref),",
    "the window sampler clock (refd) and samples (s1, s2_n), the VCTRL-movement sensor (still), the",
    "predicate (good, bad), the first counter bit (q1), the one-shot input and output (to, pt), the",
    "latch output and the block output (lockq, LOCK), so a failure is attributable to the stage",
    "that stopped.",
    "Second unit = the SAME capture at the bench's own tt corner (mos_tt / 1.2 V / 27 C): a",
    "control, so every ss observation is read against what the identical stimulus and capture",
    "produce where the block is known to pass (LOCK sets at 351 ns in the committed tt record).",
    "Submitted through the grid/batch path (--backend batch --wait-for-capacity 600).",
    "Simulated, never measured."
  ],
  "engine": "ngspice",
  "netlist": "../decks/probe.spice",
  "netlist_source": "schematic",
  "models": {
    "pdk": "ihp-sg13g2",
    "lib": "libs.tech/ngspice/models/cornerMOSlv.lib"
  },
  "analysis": {
    "kind": "tran",
    "args": "20p 800n"
  },
  "measurements": [
    {
      "name": "t_ref",
      "crossings": {
        "signal": "v(ref)",
        "level": {
          "frac_of": "Vdd",
          "fraction": 0.5
        },
        "edge": "rise",
        "max": 1000
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "t_refd",
      "crossings": {
        "signal": "v(xdut.refd)",
        "level": {
          "frac_of": "Vdd",
          "fraction": 0.5
        },
        "edge": "rise",
        "max": 1000
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "t_s1",
      "crossings": {
        "signal": "v(xdut.s1)",
        "level": {
          "frac_of": "Vdd",
          "fraction": 0.5
        },
        "edge": "either",
        "max": 1000
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "t_s2_n",
      "crossings": {
        "signal": "v(xdut.s2_n)",
        "level": {
          "frac_of": "Vdd",
          "fraction": 0.5
        },
        "edge": "either",
        "max": 1000
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "t_still",
      "crossings": {
        "signal": "v(xdut.still)",
        "level": {
          "frac_of": "Vdd",
          "fraction": 0.5
        },
        "edge": "either",
        "max": 1000
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "t_good",
      "crossings": {
        "signal": "v(xdut.good)",
        "level": {
          "frac_of": "Vdd",
          "fraction": 0.5
        },
        "edge": "either",
        "max": 1000
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "t_q1",
      "crossings": {
        "signal": "v(xdut.q1)",
        "level": {
          "frac_of": "Vdd",
          "fraction": 0.5
        },
        "edge": "either",
        "max": 1000
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "t_to",
      "crossings": {
        "signal": "v(xdut.to)",
        "level": {
          "frac_of": "Vdd",
          "fraction": 0.5
        },
        "edge": "rise",
        "max": 1000
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "t_pt",
      "crossings": {
        "signal": "v(xdut.pt)",
        "level": {
          "frac_of": "Vdd",
          "fraction": 0.5
        },
        "edge": "either",
        "max": 1000
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "t_bad",
      "crossings": {
        "signal": "v(xdut.bad)",
        "level": {
          "frac_of": "Vdd",
          "fraction": 0.5
        },
        "edge": "either",
        "max": 1000
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "t_lockq",
      "crossings": {
        "signal": "v(xdut.lockq)",
        "level": {
          "frac_of": "Vdd",
          "fraction": 0.5
        },
        "edge": "either",
        "max": 1000
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "t_lock",
      "crossings": {
        "signal": "v(lock)",
        "level": {
          "frac_of": "Vdd",
          "fraction": 0.5
        },
        "edge": "either",
        "max": 1000
      }
    }
  ],
  "options": {
    "osdi_preload": [
      "/home/ubuntu/share/pdk/ihp-sg13g2/libs.tech/ngspice/osdi/psp103.osdi",
      "/home/ubuntu/share/pdk/ihp-sg13g2/libs.tech/ngspice/osdi/psp103_nqs.osdi",
      "/home/ubuntu/share/pdk/ihp-sg13g2/libs.tech/ngspice/osdi/r3_cmc.osdi",
      "/home/ubuntu/share/pdk/ihp-sg13g2/libs.tech/ngspice/osdi/mosvar.osdi"
    ],
    "stage_model_inputs": true,
    "keep_artifacts": true,
    "timeout_s": 1800
  },
  "corners": {
    "units": [
      {
        "process": {
          "name": "ss",
          "sections": [
            "mos_ss",
            {
              "lib": "libs.tech/ngspice/models/cornerRES.lib",
              "section": "res_typ"
            },
            {
              "lib": "libs.tech/ngspice/models/cornerCAP.lib",
              "section": "cap_typ"
            }
          ]
        },
        "temperature_c": 125,
        "supply_v": {
          "Vdd": 1.08
        }
      },
      {
        "process": {
          "name": "tt",
          "sections": [
            "mos_tt",
            {
              "lib": "libs.tech/ngspice/models/cornerRES.lib",
              "section": "res_typ"
            },
            {
              "lib": "libs.tech/ngspice/models/cornerCAP.lib",
              "section": "cap_typ"
            }
          ]
        },
        "temperature_c": 27,
        "supply_v": {
          "Vdd": 1.2
        }
      }
    ]
  }
